      "rows": [
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory fragmentation",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Simultaneous MiCA compliance requirements in Europe, DFSA licensing in Dubai, U.S. stablecoin bill uncertainty, and China's state-controlled digital yuan create incompatible regulatory regimes that could Balkanize settlement corridors.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "JPM Coin processing $1B daily, Tether dominating dollar stablecoin supply, and Google Cloud launching its own L1 for payments means critical cross-border infrastructure is concentrated in a handful of private, permissioned actors.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Sanctions evasion / illicit use",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Russia's A7A5 ruble stablecoin moving $9.3B in four months under sanctions demonstrates that permissionless or lightly regulated stablecoin rails are actively exploited to circumvent geopolitical controls.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity / FX conversion",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Stablecoins accelerate settlement but do not eliminate FX risk at on/off ramps — the $100M+ raised by stablecoin FX firms signals that conversion liquidity remains a structural bottleneck, especially in thin emerging-market currency pairs.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Smart contract / technical",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Institutional tokenized deposit pilots (Ant/HSBC on Swift, Citi Token Services) rely on smart contract logic for programmable settlement; undiscovered bugs in high-value settlement contracts carry systemic clearing risk.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Market / incumbent displacement",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Swift's new framework with 50+ banks and BIS's Project Rialto show incumbents counter-innovating, meaning the window for pure-crypto rails to capture institutional volume before TradFi adapts is narrowing.",
          "source": ""
        }
      ],
